ves  have been shattered just in the past  two days thank you so much that's  heather york's west in weldon  saskatchewan  and that is global national for this  monday night i'm farah nasser and we are  going to leave you tonight at the  saskatchewan legislative building in  regina where as you can see the flags  have been lowered at half mast in the  wake of this senseless tragedy that's  left 10 people dead and more than a  dozen people hurt thank you for watching  our donna friesen is going to be  broadcasting from saskatchewan tomorrow  until next time take care of yourselves  and each other good night  [Music]
 

